.Dd March 12, 2026
.Dt DEVFS_PERMISSIONS 9
.Os Substrate
.Sh NAME
.Nm devfs_permissions
.Nd open-time permission enforcement for devfs nodes
.Sh SYNOPSIS
.In vfs/vfs.h
.Ft int
.Fn vfs_may_open "fs_node_t *node" "uint32_t uid" "uint32_t gid" "int flags"
.Sh DESCRIPTION
.Fn vfs_may_open
translates open flags into read/write permission requirements and evaluates them
against the node's mode, owner, and group using
.Fn vfs_check_permissions .
Kernel open paths call this helper before allocating an active file object.
.Sh SEE ALSO
.Xr capabilities 7 ,
.Xr request_region 9
